.TH WALLDNS 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
walldns \- provide generic reverse DNS answers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B walldns
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a minimal DNS server that synthesizes generic answers for address
lookups, suitable for firewalled hosts.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B IP, PORT
Listen address and port (defaults: 0.0.0.0 and 53).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR walldns-conf (1)
